 identical to the uninterrupted run. The test helper replaces every run's threadId with \\\"<thread-id>\\\" before hashing (`packages/lhc/test/lifecycle.test.ts:97-103`), the replay test asserts the IDs differ and then hashes `comparableSessionFile(...)` instead of raw file bytes (`packages/lhc/test/lifecycle.test.ts:282-285`), and the teardown leg uses the same normalized comparison (`packages/lhc/test/lifecycle.test.ts:296-302`). Production materialization writes the thread ID into the session header as `id: ${input.threadId}:${input.headerTimestamp}` (`packages/lhc/src/domains/thread-view/internal/materialize.ts:44-52`), while thread IDs are generated with `randomBytes` (`packages/lhc/src/domains/threads/internal/create.ts:16-19`). The implementor artifact also records this as a spec deviation, but the Story 4 spec says `Spec Deviations: None`.\"],\"reasoning\":\"1 verifier finding(s) remain unresolved.\"},{\"name\":\"scope-change-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No scope changes require further ruling.\"},{\"name\":\"production-path-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[],\"reasoning\":\"No production-path decisions require further approval.\"},{\"name\":\"baseline-status\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"baselineBefore=320\",\"baselineAfter=328\"],\"reasoning\":\"The current baseline did not drop below the prior accepted baseline.\"},{\"name\":\"receipt-readiness\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/04-lifecycle-exercise/003-implementor.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/04-lifecycle-exercise/004-verify.json\"],\"reasoning\":\"Receipt draft includes implementor evidence, verifier evidence, and a passing story gate.\"},{\"name\":\"commit-readiness\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"evidence\":[\"Caller ruling is still required before impl-lead commit.\"],\"