4-002 (doc lag): Updated epic.md AC-5.3 / TC-5.2 / TC-5.3, test-plan.md TC-5.2 row (line 38), and coverage.md Replay-determinism row (line 48) to the approved Story 4 ruling-011 contract — pull outputs literally byte-identical; materialized files byte-identical after normalizing only the random thread id, with the two ids asserted to differ and every other byte exact.\",\n    \"EV-04-002 (doc lag): Reworded tech-design DD-4 (line 94) from 'sum of stored band counts' to the approved Story 3 ruling-011 contract — loadCost.bandTokens is measured over pull's served band messages; per-band stored token counts (storedTokens) remain reported verbatim in the band section per AC-2.1.\",\n    \"EV-04-002 (doc lag): Replaced Story 3 Spec Deviations 'None.' with a full ruling-011 record (measured bandTokens; nullable sourceState for never-compacted threads), with rationale tying each to its governing AC.\",\n    \"Cleanup: removed the stale stub-era comment at src/cli/index.ts (pre-Story-3 inspect.view stub); the `case \\\"inspect view\\\"` routing is unchanged.\"\n  ],\n  \"gatesRun\": [\n    { \"scope\": \"story\", \"command\": \"pnpm verify\", \"result\": \"PASS\", \"detail\": \"red-verify (build, typecheck, lint, boundaries) + default suite — 32 files, 328 tests passed\" },\n    { \"scope\": \"epic\", \"command\": \"pnpm verify-all\", \"result\": \"PASS\", \"detail\": \"red-verify + process suite (LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1) ran — 44 files, 366 tests passed\" }\n  ],\n  \"unresolvedConcerns\": [\n    \"Two consistency follow-throughs were applied beyond the literal three-spot enumeration of EV-04-001, both within the same tech-design 'System View' section being corrected (the diagram's `.listQueuedWork` entry and the External Contracts row) so the section is internally coherent with the ratified contract; no behavior changed. tech-design DD-6 intentionally retains `listQueuedWork` because it correctly describes the read-only delta-assert test helper observing work-item rows, not a